/121746.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-25T14:38:01Z"},"body":"Follow-up to PR #106634 \r\n\r\nI am getting more C4724 warnings:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1824\" height=\"160\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-07-24 201347\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4589b918-ef14-4a5b-afd7-c2352f498102\" />\r\n\r\nI don't know how it's possible that more of these are appearing out of nowhere, even on an old branch: https://github.com/aaronfranke/godot/actions/runs/30139888717/job/89631104138\r\n\r\nI can reproduce them locally on Windows 11, so maybe it's a newer MSVC that is causing these warnings to appear.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes them in master, and the fixes should be backported to all supported branches. This PR as-is can be automatically cherry-picked to 4.5, 4.6, and 4.7, but conflicts prevent cherry-picking to 4.4 and earlier.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121746/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/god